\"text\":\"A vehicle over 7.5 tonnes needs two consecutive dock slots.\",\"line\":5,\"span\":\"A vehicle over 7.5 tonnes needs two consecutive slots\"},{\"text\":\"The facilities portal will not let you book the two consecutive slots for a vehicle over 7.5 tonnes separately.\",\"line\":5,\"span\":\"the portal will not let you book them separately\"},{\"text\":\"Dock slots open 14 days ahead.\",\"line\":9,\"span\":\"Slots open 14 days ahead and close 4 hours before the slot starts.\"},{\"text\":\"Dock slots close 4 hours before the slot starts.\",\"line\":9,\"span\":\"Slots open 14 days ahead and close 4 hours before the slot starts.\"},{\"text\":\"There is no same-hour dock booking.\",\"line\":9,\"span\":\"There is no same-hour booking.\"},{\"text\":\"The dock booking phone line was retired.\",\"line\":13,\"span\":\"The dock booking phone line was retired and the number no longer connects.\"},{\"text\":\"The dock booking phone number no longer connects.\",\"line\":13,\"span\":\"The dock booking phone line was retired and the number no longer connects.\"},{\"text\":\"All dock bookings go through the portal.\",\"line\":13,\"span\":\"All bookings go through the portal.\"},{\"text\":\"Drivers who call the old dock booking number hear a recorded message pointing them at the portal.\",\"line\":13,\"span\":\"Drivers who call the old number hear a recorded message pointing them at the portal.\"},{\"text\":\"Drivers report to the gatehouse with the booking reference.\",\"line\":17,\"span\":\"Drivers report to the gatehouse with the booking reference.\"},{\"text\":\"The gatehouse checks the booking reference against the day sheet.\",\"line\":17,\"span\":\"The gatehouse checks the reference against the day sheet and directs the vehicle to a bay.\"},{\"text\":\"The gatehouse directs the vehicle to a bay.\",\"line\":17,\"span\":\"The gatehouse checks the reference against the day sheet and directs the vehicle to a bay.\"},{\"text\":\"A driver without a booking reference waits in the holding area until a slot is free.\",\"line\":17,\"span\":\"A driver without a reference waits in the holding area until a slot is free.\"},{\"text\":\"A vehicle still on the bay 15 minutes after its slot ends is logged as an overrun.\",\"line\":21,\"span\":\"A vehicle still on the bay 15 minutes after its slot ends is logged as an overrun.\"},{\"text\":\"After three overruns in a quarter, the supplier is asked to rebook through their account manager.\",\"line\":21,\"span\":\"After three overruns in a quarter, the supplier is asked to rebook through their account manager.\"}]}","ttft_ms":8325,"type":"result","duration_ms":8362,"uuid":"6c3658ee-e0c7-430e-a37d-cd7239990c70","ttft_stream_ms":1361,"time_to_request_ms":106,"first_content_frame_ms":1362,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
